s#eventos-relevantes","content":"fallos de conexión P2P;"},"4064":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-8","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"solicitudes de unión mediante Rich Presence."},"4065":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"Estos callbacks son infraestructura. El gameplay debería reaccionar a los estados de Eco resultantes, no acoplar cada sistema del juego directamente a Steamworks."},"4066":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-10","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"Steam callback → integración Steam → Eco → sistema de juego."},"4067":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-11","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"Evita Steam callback → Torre, Steam callback → UI, Steam callback → combate, etc."},"4068":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"page","content":"Conexión P2P","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p"},"4069":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","content":"Cómo Steam transporta una conexión Eco entre dos usuarios."},"4070":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#flujo","content":"Flujo"},"4071":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"Conectar manualmente"},"4072":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"Sesiones"},"4073":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","content":"Eco implementa una conexión personalizada sobre Steam P2P mediante `IConnection`. La clase interna `P2PConnection` convierte los buffers de Eco en paquetes enviados al Steam ID remoto. fileciteturn190file0"},"4074":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#flujo","content":"El gameplay no necesita cambiar su protocolo sólo porque el transporte sea Steam."},"4075":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"La integración expone `Steam.Conectar(string)` para iniciar una conexión P2P mediante el Steam ID del usuario remoto. El README original de la integración utiliza un Steam ID numérico como ejemplo. fileciteturn189file0"},"4076":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"Si la cadena no representa un Steam ID válido, la integración no intenta tratarla como una conexión P2P y Eco puede continuar con su flujo normal."},"4077":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-8","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"La integración registra conexiones abiertas y cerradas y transforma la desconexión P2P en un estado de conexión que Eco puede procesar. fileciteturn190file0"},"4078":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"El transporte puede ser P2P, pero tu juego puede seguir siendo servidor-autoritativo. P2P describe el camino de comunicación, no quién decide el resultado de la partida."},"4079":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"page","content":"Configuración","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion"},"4080":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","content":"Preparar Steamworks para utilizar la integración de Eco."},"4081":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#app-id","content":"App ID"},"4082":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#inicialización","content":"Inicialización"},"4083":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#callbacks","content":"Callbacks"},"4084":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#editor-y-builds","content":"Editor y builds"},"4085":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","content":"La integración de Eco debe ejecutarse sólo cuando la plataforma lo permita. El código actual utiliza compilación condicionada para excluir Steam en plataformas no compatibles y en determinados modos de ejecución. fileciteturn190file0"},"4086":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-6","page_