bby-y-partidas","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","type":"page","content":"Lobby y partidas","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas"},"4165":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","content":"Diseñar el flujo de lobby sin mezclar Steam con el estado de gameplay de Eco."},"4166":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas#separación-recomendada","content":"Separación recomendada"},"4167":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas#flujo-cooperativo","content":"Flujo cooperativo"},"4168":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas#por-qué-no-usar-steam-como-autoridad","content":"Por qué no usar Steam como autoridad"},"4169":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas#hasta-cuatro-jugadores","content":"Hasta cuatro jugadores"},"4170":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","content":"Steam puede facilitar descubrimiento y unión, pero el lobby de gameplay debe seguir teniendo un estado propio."},"4171":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas#por-qué-no-usar-steam-como-autoridad","content":"Steam conoce la identidad y el transporte, pero no conoce las reglas de tu partida. Eco debe decidir si un jugador puede entrar, qué canal recibe y qué objetos se crean."},"4172":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/lobby-y-partidas#hasta-cuatro-jugadores","content":"Para un juego cooperativo de cuatro jugadores, el límite de Steam y el límite de gameplay deben considerarse por separado. El servidor debe rechazar jugadores adicionales aunque el transporte permita técnicamente una conexión."},"4173":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","type":"page","content":"Protocolo","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo"},"4174":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","content":"Qué parte del protocolo pertenece a Eco y qué parte a Steam."},"4175":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#ventaja","content":"Ventaja"},"4176":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#limitación-conceptual","content":"Limitación conceptual"},"4177":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","content":"La integración Steam no reemplaza el protocolo de Eco. Implementa un transporte que satisface `IConnection`."},"4178":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","content":"La clase `P2PConnection` recibe un `Buffer`, extrae paquetes completos y los envía al Steam ID remoto. Al desconectarse, genera el estado de desconexión que Eco puede procesar. fileciteturn190file0"},"4179":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#ventaja","content":"El código de gameplay no necesita conocer si un paquete viaja por TCP, UDP o Steam P2P. La capa de transporte mantiene esa decisión aislada."},"4180":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#limitación-conceptual","content":"Cambiar el transporte no elimina los problemas de diseño del protocolo. Tamaño de paquetes, frecuencia, serialización, ownership, destinatarios y autoridad siguen siendo responsabilidad de la arquitectura Eco."},"4181":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#limitación-conceptual","content":"Steam proporciona el camino. Eco define qué se transmite y el juego define qué significa."},"4182":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"page","content":"Rich Presence","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence"},"4183":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","content":"Utilizar la presencia de Steam para anunciar el estado de conexión."},"4184":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#estado","content":"Estado"},"4185":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#amigos-con-partida","content":"Amigos con partida"},"4186":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#seguridad","content":"Seguridad"},"4187":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","content":"La integración de Eco utiliza la clave `connect` de Steam Rich Presence como puente para la función de unirse a una partida."},"4188":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","content":"No debe confundirse Rich Presence con un sistema de lobby de Eco. Es una capa de descubrimiento y experiencia de usuario."},"4189":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#estado","content":"`Steam.PermitirUnirseAmigos` actualiza ese valor según el estado de la conexión. fileciteturn190file0"},"4190":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#amigos-con-partida","content":"La integración dispone de `ObtenerAmigosConPartida()`, que recorre los amigos inmediatos y busca el campo `connect` para identificar aquellos que anuncian una partida. fileciteturn190file0"},"4191":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-8","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#amigos-con-partida","content":"Esto permite construir una UI propia de \"amigos jugando\" sin hacer que Steam determine la estructura del lobby Eco."},"4192":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#seguridad","content":"El valor `connect` debe tratarse como una pista de descubrimiento. La entrada real debe validarse en Eco."},"4193":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","type":"page","content":"Unirse a amigos","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos"},"4194":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","content":"Permitir que un amigo de Steam entre directamente en una partida."},"4195":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#flujo","content":"Flujo"},"4196":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#permitir-unirse","content":"Permitir unirse"},"4197":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#cuándo-habilitarlo","content":"Cuándo habilitarlo"},"4198":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","content":"La integración utiliza Rich Presence para publicar un valor `connect` que contiene la información necesaria para iniciar la conexión."},"4199":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#flujo","content":"El código actual analiza `+connect` en los argumentos de línea de comandos para detectar este arranque automático. fileciteturn190file0"},"4200":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#permitir-unirse","content":"`Steam.PermitirUnirseAmigos(true)` publica la información de conexión cuando existe una sesión que pueda recibir jugadores. Si se desactiva, limpia el campo `connect`."},"4201":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#permitir-unirse","content":"El comportamiento depende de si Eco está actuando como servidor, utiliza una conexión P2P personalizada o dispone de un punto TCP. fileciteturn190file0"},"4202":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-8","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#cuándo-habilitarlo","content":"No lo actives automáticamente durante todo el ciclo de vida si tu juego tiene matchmaking, lobby privado o estados donde no se debe admitir a nuevos jugadores."},"4203":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos#cuándo-habilitarlo","content":"Rich Presence anuncia una ruta de conexión; no sustituye la autorización de tu servidor. La partida debe validar al jugador cuando intenta entrar."},"4204":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad","type":"page","content":"Buffer en profundidad","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Transporte"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad"},"4205":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad","content":"Ciclo de escritura, lectura, reciclado y uso seguro de Buffer."},"4206":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad#buffer-en-profundidad","content":"Buffer en profundidad"},"4207":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffer-en-profundidad-2","page_id":"/docs/red